								<li class="relative pl-5 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.7em] before:h-1.5 before:w-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-accent">Conducted domain mapping, port scanning, and vulnerability assessments using open-source and proprietary security tools.</li>
								<li class="relative pl-5 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.7em] before:h-1.5 before:w-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-accent">Selected as the sole intern to participate in a focus group contributing to the organisation’s 2023–2028 Strategic Plan.</li>
							</ul>
						</article>
						<article>
							<div class="flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">
								<h3 class="text-lg font-medium">Software Developer · Shades of Ruth</h3>
								<p class="text-sm text-muted">May 2022 – Sep 2022</p>
							</div>
							<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Nairobi, Kenya</p>
							<p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted">Developed and enhanced a responsive e-commerce application, supporting product, customer, and order management functionality, including an administrative interface.</p>
						</article>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section aria-labelledby="projects-title">
					<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Portfolio</p>
					<h2 id="projects-title" class="mt-3 font-heading text-3xl">Selected projects</h2>
