								<p class="text-sm text-muted">2025 – 2026</p>
							</div>
							<p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted">Developed a data-driven system for analysing large volumes of unstructured application logs to identify relationships between microservices, combining structured extraction, semantic analysis, information retrieval, and AI-based reasoning.</p>
						</article>
						<article>
							<h3 class="text-lg font-medium"><a class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4" href="/projects/shades-of-ruth">Shades of Ruth</a> · E-commerce application</h3>
							<p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted">Built and enhanced a responsive storefront with product, customer, order, and administration workflows.</p>
						</article>
						<article>
							<h3 class="text-lg font-medium"><a class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4" href="/projects/innobid">InnoBid</a> · Procurement-transparency concept</h3>
							<p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted">Contributed to the prototype and anomaly-detection concept for identifying procurement bids that deviate from expected pricing patterns.</p>
						</article>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section aria-labelledby="achievements-title">
					<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Beyond the role</p>
