						<li><strong class="text-foreground">Hackcorruption Hackathon · Accountability Lab</strong> — Won the competition with a digital solution for government procurement transparency and received a $10,000 development award.</li>
						<li><strong class="text-foreground">Microsoft Africa Development Center Software Engineering Mentorship Program</strong> — Collaborated in a five-person team on a sustainable agriculture solution for Kenyan farmers; placed second.</li>
